  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Glorious Arena</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> tension pool, any metamagic feat</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you create a sphere effect which would have its casting time increased by one or more metamagic feats, you may spend 2 points of tension per metamagic feat to ignore any casting time increases.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you possess the Spell Tokens drawback, you may select this feat as a drawback feat and may use tension points in place of spell tokens.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc68\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
